    "subTopics": [
      {
        "id": "sub-1",
        "title": "1. The Exact Position Sizing Formula: Calculating Lots Based on Stop Loss",
        "content": "\n          <p class=\"mb-3\">Never choose your lot size first and adjust your stop loss to fit. ALWAYS determine your technical chart stop loss first, and calculate your exact lot size:</p>\n          <div class=\"bg-tradeDark p-3 rounded-lg border border-tradeBorder font-mono text-xs text-accentGold my-2\">\n            Lots = (Total Capital &times; 1% Risk) &divide; (Technical Point Stop &times; Lot Size)\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"mb-3\">If you have ₹2,00,000 capital, your max risk per trade is 1% = ₹2,000. If Nifty's stop loss is 20 points (₹500 per lot), you can trade exactly 4 lots. No more, no less.</p>\n        "
      },
      {
        "id": "sub-2",
        "title": "2. The Mathematical Proof of Asymmetry: Why a 40% Win Rate Generates Fortune",
        "content": "\n          <p class=\"mb-3\">Let us examine 10 institutional trades risking ₹1,000 to make ₹3,000 (1:3 Risk to Reward):</p>\n          <ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-gray-300\">\n            <li><strong>6 Losing Trades (60% Loss Rate):</strong> 6 &times; -₹1,000 = -₹6,000.</li>\n            <li><strong>4 Winning Trades (40% Win Rate):</strong> 4 &times; +₹3,000 = +₹12,000.</li>\n            <li><strong>Net Portfolio Result:</strong> +₹12,000 - ₹6,000 = <strong>+₹6,000 NET PROFIT</strong>.</li>\n          </ul>\n          <p class=\"mb-3\">You were wrong most of the time, and you still made 60% return on risk capital. That is the statistical power of institutional trading.</p>\n        "
      },
      {
        "id": "sub-3",
        "title": "3. The 3-Strike Daily Circuit Breaker Rule: Killing Revenge Trading",
        "content": "\n          <p class=\"mb-3\">If you hit 3 consecutive stop losses in a single trading day, your trading terminal must be locked automatically. Three consecutive losses prove either market conditions do not fit your strategy today or your emotional psychology is compromised. Step away and live to fight tomorrow.</p>\n        "
      }
    ],
    "tradeDetails": {
      "setupType": "Institutional Asymmetric Capital Defense Protocol",
      "instrument": "Trading Portfolio Risk Engine",
      "entryTrigger": "Pre-calculated position size verified before clicking buy",
      "stopLoss": "Hard broker stop loss placed immediately upon order execution",
      "target1": "2R (Sell 50% lots, move stop loss to breakeven)",
      "target2": "3.5R to 5R (Let final runner run with trailing stop)",
      "riskReward": "1:3.0 Minimum",
      "executionChecklist": [
        "Risk on this trade is strictly &le; 1% of total trading account balance",
        "Stop loss is based on technical market structure, not an arbitrary dollar figure",
        "Risk-to-reward ratio to the first major target is at least 1:2.0",
        "No open trades if daily 3-strike circuit breaker has triggered"
      ],
      "pitfalls": [
        "Averaging down on a losing options position",
        "Increasing position size after a loss to 'win it back' (revenge trading)"
      ]
    },
